  "lines": [
    {"start": 0, "end": 2.6, "text": "Past *450 meters,* it doesn't matter how high you fall.", "accent": "orange", "hold": true},
    {"start": 2.6, "end": 3.5, "text": "*One meter.*", "accent": "cyan"},
    {"start": 3.5, "end": 4.5, "text": "*Three.*", "accent": "orange"},
    {"start": 4.5, "end": 6.4, "text": "Fifteen: that's a *coin flip.*", "accent": "red"},
    {"start": 6.4, "end": 8.6, "text": "Then, at 450… the *needle stops.*", "accent": "red"},
    {"start": 8.6, "end": 11.4, "text": "Air pushes up as hard as *gravity pulls down.*", "accent": "cyan"},
    {"start": 11.4, "end": 14.0, "text": "Ten kilometers? *Same 200 kilometers an hour.*", "accent": "orange"},
    {"start": 14.0, "end": 17.0, "text": "In 1972, a flight attendant fell that far. *And lived.*", "accent": "cyan"},
    {"start": 17.0, "end": 21.4, "text": "At 39 kilometers, the air's so thin, Felix Baumgartner *broke the sound barrier.*", "accent": "red"},
    {"start": 21.4, "end": 23.8, "text": "Then thick air *braked him* back to 200.", "accent": "cyan"},
    {"start": 23.8, "end": 25.0, "text": "And at *400 kilometers?*", "accent": "cyan"},
    {"start": 25.0, "end": 26.6, "text": "The Space Station is *falling right now.*", "accent": "red"},
    {"start": 26.6, "end": 30.4, "text": "Just sideways so fast it *keeps missing the ground.*", "accent": "cyan"}
  ],
